BuilderChannel
/ Builder channel sink. Goal-backed channel registered at Build start so all
/ build-time output flows through one named seam — later we can swap the consumer
/ (file log, TUI, structured stream) without touching the call sites.
/ What the builder writes reaches this goal as its argument %message%.
/ An event the output template has no line for renders empty, and prints nothing.
- condition.if(Left=%message%, Operator="isnotempty") { output.write(Data=%message%) }
